# D-191: the threads contentionTest starts run this operation, which `machine.testThreadEntry` gives the address of.
# Its work block: 0 a mutex, 8 a counter cell, 16 how many rounds, 24 what to do, 32 a condition variable, 40 a flag
# cell, 48 a deadline, 56 a C function.
workerThread is operation
workerThread purpose "A test thread (D-191): by the work block's mode, 0 adds 1 to the counter in each round under mtx_lock, 1 the same under mtx_timedlock, a read and its write a yield apart; 2 waits under the mutex for the flag, answers on the counter, and signals back; 3 times out locking the mutex another thread holds; 4 times out waiting on a condition variable no one signals and still holds the mutex after; 5 passes call_once the flag and the function; 6 flushes every stream in each round. Gives 7, the timeouts 4 once the deadline has passed, and 99 for anything wrong"
