contentionTest is test
contentionTest purpose "On Windows (D-191) threads block in the system: four threads add 1 to a counter 2000 times each, a read and its write a yield apart, under a plain, a recursive, and a timed mutex (that one through mtx_timedlock), and the counter is 8000 each time; a condition variable hands a flag to a waiting thread and its answer back; a timed lock of a mutex another thread holds and a timed wait no one signals each give thrd_timedout once their deadline, 30 ms ahead, has passed, the wait holding its mutex again; four threads' call_once calls rand once; four threads flush every stream 500 times each under the streams' lock"
contentionTest verifies windowsLock waitsBlocked
contentionTest verifies windowsWait givesBackAndWaits
contentionTest verifies waitMilliseconds roundsUp
